cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "REDTEXT Generator"
message: "If you use REDTEXT Generator in research or training, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: keuchnotkush
    website: "https://github.com/keuchnotkush"
repository-code: "https://github.com/keuchnotkush/redtext-generator"
abstract: >-
  REDTEXT Generator is a pure-Python, dependency-free tool that produces
  fictional social-engineering scenarios (phishing, smishing, quishing,
  vishing, and physical pretexts) for authorized red-team operations and
  security-awareness training. Scenarios are mapped to MITRE ATT&CK techniques
  with detection-gap analysis, support English/French/Spanish/German output,
  and integrate optionally with GoPhish.
keywords:
  - social-engineering
  - red-team
  - penetration-testing
  - security-awareness
  - MITRE ATT&CK
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: 2.1.0
